<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: bullhound -->
  <DMS_Mech_BullHound.label>斗牛犬</DMS_Mech_BullHound.label>
  <!-- EN: A heavy quadruped automatroid built for garrison duty. An enlarged derivative of the Dogge, it gives up the artificial-muscle agility of its smaller cousin for thick plating and a fixed back mount, and was posted at gates and corridor junctions of remnant installations to stop intruders at close range.

This pattern mounts an automatic shotgun. The mount is fixed and cannot be swapped. -->
  <DMS_Mech_BullHound.description>一种为驻防任务打造的重型四足机兵。作为獒犬的放大衍生型，它舍弃了小型同族靠人工肌肉换来的灵活性，换上厚重装甲与固定的背部挂架，被部署在残余设施的闸门与走廊交会处，于近距离拦下入侵者。

本型号挂载一挺自动霰弹枪。挂架为固定式，无法更换。</DMS_Mech_BullHound.description>
  <!-- EN: jaws -->
  <DMS_Mech_BullHound.tools.jaws.label>颚部</DMS_Mech_BullHound.tools.jaws.label>
  <!-- EN: ram -->
  <DMS_Mech_BullHound.tools.ram.label>冲撞</DMS_Mech_BullHound.tools.ram.label>

  <!-- EN: bullhound (flamer) -->
  <DMS_Mech_BullHound_Flamer.label>斗牛犬（喷火型）</DMS_Mech_BullHound_Flamer.label>
  <!-- EN: A heavy quadruped automatroid built for garrison duty. An enlarged derivative of the Dogge, it gives up the artificial-muscle agility of its smaller cousin for thick plating and a fixed back mount, and was posted at gates and corridor junctions of remnant installations to stop intruders at close range.

This pattern mounts a Flameblaster for clearing corridors, with its plating treated against its own flame. The mount is fixed and cannot be swapped. -->
  <DMS_Mech_BullHound_Flamer.description>一种为驻防任务打造的重型四足机兵。作为獒犬的放大衍生型，它舍弃了小型同族靠人工肌肉换来的灵活性，换上厚重装甲与固定的背部挂架，被部署在残余设施的闸门与走廊交会处，于近距离拦下入侵者。

本型号挂载火焰发射器用于清扫走廊，装甲亦针对自身火焰做了处理。挂架为固定式，无法更换。</DMS_Mech_BullHound_Flamer.description>
  <!-- EN: jaws -->
  <DMS_Mech_BullHound_Flamer.tools.jaws.label>颚部</DMS_Mech_BullHound_Flamer.tools.jaws.label>
  <!-- EN: ram -->
  <DMS_Mech_BullHound_Flamer.tools.ram.label>冲撞</DMS_Mech_BullHound_Flamer.tools.ram.label>

</LanguageData>
